  "readme": [
    "CYANIDE WEB-SERVICES",
    "",
    "Welcome to Cyanide's web-services entry point!",
    "",
    "Here, under 'services', you will find the list of all web-services your API key gives you access to.",
    "For each service, it presents:",
    "- the list of parameters/options, with accepted values and defaults,",
    "- a changelog, which can give extra information on how it works.",
    "",
    "REQUIREMENTS",
    "",
    "We kindly ask for a controlled usage of it on your side. Meaning no abuse nor excessive usage of it.",
    "Please cache the data/results on your side and do not make all the requests at the same time.",
    "Also note that we apply daily quotas on your usage. Any request exeeding those quotas will fail.",
    "",
    "Your current quotas: 1000 requests per hour / 10000 requests per day",
    "",
    "We expect from you that",
    "- you communicate to us the addresses of the websites, discord channels, tools, apps or",
    "any kind of piece of software that uses our API. Thanks in advance for that.",
    "- you communicate to us your real name, and a valid personnal email address",
    "",
    "Do not communicate your API key to anyone else. It's private and associated to your own use of it.",
    "",
    "SUPPORT",
    "",
    "Please note that those webservices are provided 'as-is' and that we cannot guarantee a big support on it.",
    "You can considerate this services as “beta”. That means there might be bugs and that sometimes things get broken.",
    "Also sometimes services are down. If you detect any missfunctionning please let us know.",
    "",
    "Feel free to contact us if you are experiencing problems, or have feature or improvements requests.",
    "",
    "NB. In order to access BB3 version of Blood Bowl webservices, don't forget to add the &bb=3 argument to URls."
  ],
